Package: crossex
Type: Package
Title: Interactive Data Exploration Widgets for Data Frames
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("David", "Craig", email = "david.w.craig@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Renders an interactive exploration environment for a data frame:
    dynamically configurable charts (scatter, line, histogram, box, violin,
    stacked bar, heatmap, correlation matrix), faceting, filtering,
    formula-based column transforms, summary statistics, a data table, a 3D
    unit view, and CSV/PNG/SVG export. Everything runs client side through the
    bundled 'crossex' JavaScript library, which is built on the 'Vega'
    visualization grammar <https://vega.github.io/vega/>. Widgets work in the
    'RStudio' viewer, 'Shiny' applications, and 'R Markdown' documents.
